'' A NON-GENERIC PROCEDURE WHOSE SIGNATURE NAMES A GENERIC INSTANCE crosses as a 'declare'
'' (RFC-0004 §7) and links to the module's one definition: std's containers.Map as a parameter,
'' containers.Array as a result, the module's own Box( of long ) as a result, and a non-generic
'' type's out-of-line member taking containers.Array. Each was taken for a generic -- '( of' anywhere
'' in the header -- so its body went into the interface too, and the link failed on a
'' duplicate symbol for every one. A generic procedure, 'Largest( of T )' and 'Smallest( Of T )',
'' still travels whole and is instantiated here. 'calls' counts the module's own definitions.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc -i tests/modules/src/genparam/libs tests/modules/src/genparam/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/genparamlink.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: duplicate symbol
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/genparamlink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/genparamlink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3             6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  12
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  6             2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  4
